# Keeps the build context to what docker/termproof.Dockerfile actually copies:
# the manifests, the toolchain pin, `crates/` and `docker/`. `target/` alone is
# multiple gigabytes locally and would otherwise be uploaded to the daemon on
# every build, only to be ignored.
.git
.github
.specify
docs
harness
specs
target
.claude
.termproof
